    },
    {
      "id": "02-read-path:cq2-42",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22,
      "y": 1786,
      "width": 1138.5140380859375,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 23891813,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 466659365,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792704165717,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Writes are rare, so almost every read is a hit. The lessons in 'caching at scale' are about the tail: the few slow misses and the slow clients.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Writes are rare, so almost every read is a hit. The lessons in 'caching at scale' are about the tail: the few slow misses and the slow clients.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "03-kinesis-vs-sns:cq3-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 725.898193359375,
      "height": 42.5,
      "angle": 0,
