      "text": "Each region reads the WHOLE stream.\nInside a region, ONE worker per shard of the\nstream writes DynamoDB (KCL keeps a lease per\nshard, like a Kafka consumer group).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each region reads the WHOLE stream.\nInside a region, ONE worker per shard of the\nstream writes DynamoDB (KCL keeps a lease per\nshard, like a Kafka consumer group).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
